tate\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-08]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2026-02-27\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3974113940  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2026-02-27T17:20:46Z · **Updated**: 2026-02-27T17:21:05Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-27  \\n\\n## Attendees\\n\\n- Robert Pająk  \\n\\n- Damien Mathieu  \\n\\n- Nico Hertz  \\n\\n- Michal Jarmolkiewicz  \\n\\n- Bryan Boreham  \\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-08]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2026-02-27\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3974113940  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2026-02-27T17:20:46Z · **Updated**: 2026-02-27T17:21:05Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-27  \\n\\n## Discussions\\n\\n### 1. PR Review Request (Profiling / Runtime Tracer)\\n\\n- Request for reviews on Nico’s PR related to Go runtime profiling (`pprof`) integration.\\n\\n- Current behavior: each span creates a runtime tracing **task**, which introduces noise in profiles.\\n\\n- Proposal:\\n\\n  - Provide more control over task/region creation.\\n\\n  - Different modes:\\n\\n    - **Default**: create a task only for the root span.\\n\\n    - **Auto mode**: task for root span, regions for child spans.\\n\\n    - **Manual mode**: explicit task/region instrumentation by the user.\\n\\n  - Optional async-style hint to indicate spans that cross goroutines.\\n\\n- Key considerations:\\n\\n  - Tasks can span multiple goroutines; regions must stay within a single goroutine.\\n\\n  - Changing public tracing APIs is sensitive and tightly coupled to the specification.\\n\\n  - Risk of breaking changes for existing instrumentation (e.g., Kafka libraries).\\n\\n- Recommendation:\\n\\n  - Start with a smaller, incremental change (e.g., ability to disable runtime tracing integration).\\n\\n  - Open an issue describing:\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src note 08 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2026 02 27 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3974113940 author pellar creat 2026 02 27t17 20 46z updat 2026 02 27t17 21 05z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 27 attende robert paj ą k damien mathieu nico hertz michal jarmolkiewicz bryan boreham sourc id src note 08 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2026 02 27 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3974113940 author pellar creat 2026 02 27t17 20 46z updat 2026 02 27t17 21 05z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 27 discuss 1 pr review request profil runtim tracer request for review on nico s pr relat to go runtim profil pprof integr current behavior each span creat a runtim trace task which introduc nois in profil propos provid more control over task region creation differ mode default creat a task onli for the root span auto mode task for root span region for child span manual mode explicit task region instrument by the user option async style hint to indic span that cross goroutin key consider task can span multipl goroutin region must stay within a singl goroutin chang public trace api is sensit and tight coupl to the specif risk of break chang for exist instrument e g kafka librari recommend start with a smaller increment chang e g abil to disabl runtim trace integr open an issu describ\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"0737354a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"id\": \"5136ab127d1963ff\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.5374988365809911, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.4230769236871302, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8044833, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"docu